    <string-array name="guide">
        <item>touch the dot on a task|change its priority</item>
        <item>hold a task, then swipe right|move it to the bin</item>
        <item>hold a task, then swipe left|rename it</item>
        <item>hold a task, then drag|move it: the middle of a task puts it inside, a line puts it above the task under the line</item>
        <item>touch a task while typing|add the next task inside it</item>
        <item>the dot at the top|switch between your own order and priority order</item>
        <item>sweep sideways anywhere|switch tabs</item>
        <item>hold a note or an event, then swipe right|move it to its bin</item>
        <item>hold a note, then drag|put it somewhere else in the list</item>
        <item>hold any tab|open the settings</item>
